<BaseLayout title="Privacy"><div class="wrap static-page"><span class="eyebrow">Respect for readers</span><h1>Privacy, by design.</h1><div class="prose"><p>This initial version is a static educational website. It has no visitor accounts, newsletter subscriptions, contact form, cookies intentionally set by our application, or site-integrated analytics.</p><p>Our hosting provider may process ordinary request information, such as IP addresses, for security and delivery. We have not added third-party advertising trackers or visitor profiling services.</p><p>Readers may optionally choose the Google Translate language selector to open a Google-hosted translated version of the current page. When selected, the browser navigates to a Google Translate-hosted <code>translate.goog</code> address for the current page and target language. Google may retrieve and process the public page content to provide the translation. This service is provided by Google and is subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. Machine translations may be inaccurate. The site does not load Google's retired embedded Website Translator script or send page content to a project-owned translation API.</p><p>If future versions add forms, analytics or accounts, we will revise this notice before enabling those features. This page should be reviewed against the actual deployed hosting configuration before public launch.</p></div></div></BaseLayout>
